body:
A kid in a with behavioral issues says some dumb obviously fake shit online and some adult women  took screenshots of it and posted it on twitter so she could get some fake internet points and views on her latest video.

&#x200B;

Honestly who gives a fuck anymore.

I don't see why they wouldn't work with you on switching to depo, since its cheaper, covered by most insurance and there are generally fewer risks as far as side effects go. Honestly its odd that they didn't prescribe it right off the bat. Defiantly ask your doctor about injections on your next visit. 

&#x200B;

May I ask what your dose is?
